# Blueprint -- a technical drawing of a dungeon
#
# Deep drawing-office blue, and everything drafted on top of it in chalk.
# Hues are pulled hard towards cyan so the map reads as one drawing, and
# the warm families are left just warm enough to stand out as the things
# that will kill you.

name    Blueprint
blurb   White lines on drawing-office blue.

